# Generated runtime config. Written by scripts/config.mjs from deploy_config.json's active
# profile, so a tracked copy would encode one developer's local machine and churn on every
# profile switch. `npm run dev` and `npm run build` both generate it; `npm run preview` serves
# the copy build placed in dist/; e2e stubs it per-page (see e2e/fixtures.ts).
# After a fresh clone, run `npm run config` before any bare `vite` invocation.
public/config.json

